# Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (41-43): the Horde quests of Grom'gol, Booty Bay,
# Nesingwary's camp, Stonard and the Harborage, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/stranglethorn_vale_swamp_of_sorrows_41_43.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Stranglethorn Vale, area
# 33; Swamp of Sorrows, area 8). The quest list is section 2 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md.
# Several quests here follow 30-40 Stranglethorn quests (Hunt for Yenniku, Singing Blue Shards,
# Bloodscalp Ears, the first Mastery quests...) that an earlier guide does.
# Left out:
#   The Drowned City (95775), The Only Good Brinescale... (95776), Shady Saltseers (95789) and
#   The Saltseer Captain (95791): inside the Drowned City, a dungeon. A Tale Spun Around the Fire
#   (96078) follows The Drowned City.
#   Trollbane (638) and Sunken Treasure (670): handed in in the Arathi Highlands.
#   Grim Message (2932): its pike is planted in a Witherbark village of the Hinterlands.
#   Twice Misplaced Trust (97332): handed in at Powderfuse Port in the Riverglades.
#
# The route: Grom'gol and three short trips west (the Vile Reef, the Bloodscalp ruins); Booty Bay
# to take its quests; a loop north (Nesingwary's camp, the Kurzen compound, the Venture Co. camp,
# the panthers); a loop east (the jungle stalkers, Lake Nazferiti, the Skullsplitter ruins, the
# Mosh'Ogg mound); north through Duskwood to the Swamp of Sorrows; the hearthstone to Booty Bay;
# the boat to Ratchet and a flight to Orgrimmar.

# Carried from earlier guides (skipped by those who lack them): The Troll Witchdoctor, Sunken
# Treasure, Report to Helgrum, Stinky's Escape. Left to later guides: The Visiting Mage, Rumors for
# Kravel, Goblin Sponsorship (1183), Tran'rek, Stoley's Debt, Marg Speaks.

guide Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (41-43)
faction horde
levels 41 43
carry 669 1137 1240 1270 1420
leave 1117 1137 1183 1261 2864 2872 93464
next Desolace & Shen'dralas (43-43)

